{
  "summary": "Validates redeem scripts and public key hashes inside BIP-352 silent payment input extraction in GetPubKeyFromInput. It ensures the redeem script matches the UTXO's P2SH script hash, enforces BIP-16 single-element push and standard P2WPKH witness stack sizes, and verifies extracted pubkeys match the witness program.",
  "problem": "GetPubKeyFromInput evaluated P2SH scriptSig redeem scripts using Solver without checking that the redeem script hashed to the UTXO's scriptPubKey hash, because Solver immediately cleared the solutions vector. As a result, non-P2WPKH P2SH inputs or mismatched inputs could erroneously be detected as eligible silent payment inputs and added to the public key sum, silently corrupting the input hash and shared secret derivation.",
  "evidence": [
    "PR description: 'an input spending any arbitrary P2SH UTXO (e.g. multisig, escrow, DLC) whose scriptSig evaluates to a valid P2WPKH script is erroneously identified as an eligible BIP-352 input. Its public key is extracted and added to A_sum, silently corrupting the input hash and the derived shared secret.'"
  ],
